<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.0.70.26255</AssemblyVersion>
	  
    <Title>HandyUI</Title>
	<Description>Platform-agnostic Code-Only C# UI framework powered by SkiaSharp.</Description>
	<PackageReleaseNotes>(NuGet) Release notes for:
 - HandyUI.Core (v1.0.50.26254)
 - HandyUI.WinForms (v1.0.52.26254)

Changes
 - Made retained positioning mode on by default. (Child-Parent positioning)

Improvements &amp; Bug Fixes
 - Fixed some control bugs.
 - Made controls consistent.
 - Made controls work with retained positioning mode.
 - Made the Resource Manager platform-agnostic.

New Features &amp; UI Controls
 - Added new controls: CheckBox, ProgressBar, Slider, TextBox, and Frame
 - Created the Resource Manager Helper.</PackageReleaseNotes>
	<PackageTags>ui;framework;skiasharp;code-only;gui;rendering</PackageTags>
	<PackageId>HandyUI.Core</PackageId>
	<Version>$(AssemblyVersion)</Version>
	<Authors>davpnuser</Authors>
    <PackageIcon>HandyUI-Logo.png</PackageIcon>
    <NeutralLanguage>en</NeutralLanguage>
	<PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
	<PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
	<RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/davpnuser/HandyUI/</RepositoryUrl>
	<RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
	<PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/davpnuser/HandyUI/</PackageProjectUrl>
  </PropertyGroup>
	
